00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,780
You shipped the code. Can you explain it?

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:07,780
Ownit. 1–3 short questions about your change, right in your terminal.

3
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:13,780
Start with why. Explain the purpose of your change.

4
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:19,780
Explain how it works. Pass the debrief to verify the push.

5
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:24,780
A small habit. A clearer understanding. Debrief now or come back later.

6
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:30,000
Own the code you ship. Install getownit. Setup in the README.
